                            "script": "\tdb \u003d self.view.custom.dbConnection\n\ttableReason \u003d mes_core.model.statereasonTable(db)\n\tds \u003d tableReason.selectCustom(columns \u003d [\u0027ID\u0027], where_clause \u003d \u0027NodeID \u003d ? AND ReasonName \u003d ?\u0027, where_args \u003d [self.view.params.nodeID,self.view.custom.inName] )\n\tmes_core.logging.log(\"Dautom\", \"[Popup anadir Razon/Subrazon] nodeID:{}\".format(self.view.params.nodeID), \"warn\")\n\tif self.view.params.function \u003d\u003d \u0027Crear\u0027:\n\t\n\t\tif ds.getRowCount()\u003e0:\n\t\t\tself.view.custom.textLabel \u003d \u0027Ya existe una Razon/Subrazon con ese nombre para el nodo selecionado\u0027\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\ttableReason.insert(nodeid \u003d self.view.params.nodeID,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treasonname \u003d self.view.custom.inName,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treasoncode \u003d self.view.custom.inCode,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trecorddowntime \u003d self.view.custom.inRecordDownTime,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tplanneddowntime \u003d self.view.custom.inPlanned,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\toperatorselectable \u003dself.view.custom.inSelOpetator,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsubreasonof\u003dself.view.custom.inSubfun)\n\t\t\talerts.actionSuccess(\u0027Razon/Subrazon Creada\u0027, \u0027Razon/Subrazon creada exitosamente\u0027)\n\t\t\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027createedit-reason\u0027)\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t# Refresh (verifica que el message handler exista con ese nombre)\n\t\t\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\"refreshTableReason\", payload\u003d{})\n\t\n\telse :\n\t\tif ds.getRowCount()\u003e0:\n\t\t\tself.view.custom.textLabel \u003d \u0027Ya existe una Razon/Subrazon con ese nombre para el nodo selecionado\u0027\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\ttableReason.updateID(self.view.params.selection.selID,{\n\t\t\t\u0027ReasonName\u0027: self.view.custom.inName,\n\t\t\t\u0027ReasonCode\u0027: self.view.custom.inCode,\n\t\t\t\u0027RecordDowntime\u0027: self.view.custom.inRecordDownTime,\n\t\t\t\u0027PlannedDowntime\u0027: self.view.custom.inPlanned,\n\t\t\t\u0027OperatorSelectable\u0027: self.view.custom.inSelOpetator,\n\t\t\t\u0027SubReasonOf\u0027: self.view.custom.inSubfun\n\t\t})\n\t\t\talerts.actionSuccess(\u0027Razon/Subrazon actualizada\u0027, \u0027Razon/Subrazon actualizada exitosamente\u0027)\n\t\t\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027createedit-reason\u0027)\n\t\t\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\"refreshTableReason\", payload\u003d{})\n\t\t"
